old black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate: replace the fixed 60s/20s/10s/15s wall clocks in the suite-gate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]integration test with budgets calibrated from measured child admission [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]latency, and fail with child diagnostics instead of a bare [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]TimeoutExpired.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Close the ACE visual convergence gap[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual: stop Textual animations from running under PNG snapshot tests [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and teach the convergence helper to treat pending animations as [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unfinished work, so a starved app cannot present five identical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mid-animation frames.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Revalidate and record the contention baseline[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]baseline[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate, visual[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]baseline: rerun the visual contention harness and the suite-gate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]integration test under load, confirm both phases hold together, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refresh the recorded harness baseline.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-e9","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","phase_bead_id":"sase-e9.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e9de9bdbc1c1f5d7e4f4cfa680f94485","started_at":"2026-08-02T14:19:20.748965+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"a71e828c9d7d4266d44bf7d74bf1130d1d536112acbba71b96d4bba44d7b8ef9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e9.l